  "Une itération : z = Ay, μ = la plus grande composante, y ← z/μ. Rayleigh : yᵀAy / yᵀy.": "One iteration: z = Ay, μ = the largest component, y ← z/μ. Rayleigh: yᵀAy / yᵀy.",
