  "Si les colonnes de la matrice de design X sont orthogonales, les β̂ⱼ se calculent séparément : β̂ⱼ = (Xᵀy)ⱼ/(XᵀX)ⱼⱼ.": "If the columns of the design matrix X are orthogonal, the β̂ⱼ are computed separately: β̂ⱼ = (Xᵀy)ⱼ/(XᵀX)ⱼⱼ.",
